{"server":"tw","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_06_beg","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_06","title":"告解","storyCode":"MT-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2089a80763680b9b1f1e0cf461ea5407b27b1d44cd04adf45833166634750e9a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"蕾繆安審問能天使時，一輛告解車突入現場營救能天使——原來能天使一直與之密謀的告解車竟是博士。蕾繆安最終決定放走能天使，博士與Mon3tr碰面，確認了拉特蘭種種異常的根源所在。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是聖席奧多爾綜合學校建校以來最盛大的畢業典禮……不，那是整個拉特蘭教育史上最盛大的畢業典禮！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"十七發巨型煙火在天空炸開，十七歲的紅髮薩科塔放肆刷弦，開始了她的搖滾獨唱會。聲音響徹校園，連附近教學大樓的窗戶都為之震動。\n舞台附近的長椅上、聖像旁、水池邊……到處都擺滿了各式各樣的蘋果派，那是她為到場的聽眾們準備的禮物。\n但是整個廣場空空如也，紅髮薩科塔一個人彈琴、一個人唱歌，並沒有一個老師或學生來捧她的場。\n自己設計畢業典禮在拉特蘭並不稀奇，但她畢竟還沒到畢業的年齡，哪怕已經讀完了大學的預修課程，還是不被允許提前畢業。\n但缺了儀式感簡直罪過！大罪過！\n教室裡的學生們打開了窗戶，遠遠地看著紅髮薩科塔忘情地彈琴、忘情地唱歌，直到最後一首。然後，他們看見了畢生難忘的畫面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅髮薩科塔彈完了收尾的音符，鞠躬致謝，然後，校門在轟響中打開，上百輛自律告解車浩浩蕩蕩地開進校園。\n在本應是賓客的位置，每一輛告解車都車門大敞，上百個聲線各異的“車載電子告解師”以最大的音量加入了紅髮薩科塔的演出。\n不論是拉特蘭規模最大的誦經團還是最為喧鬧的重金屬樂隊，過去都不曾製造過這樣的響動！\n終於，戍衛隊趕來恢復教學秩序，他們一邊勸告一邊驅趕，試圖讓告解車們回歸崗位。此時，騷亂的元兇卻早已無影無蹤……\n只剩一條布條伴隨著最後一枚煙火展開——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“熱烈慶祝蕾繆樂開始她的冒險！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾繆樂在拉特蘭的接駁港停了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這裡竟然也有一尊聖徒像呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，為什麼以前從來沒注意到，這些雕像……還蠻漂亮的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這是她第一次離開拉特蘭，去沒有光環的地方，找一些人、一些答案。\n可能有很長一段時間，自己都不會回來吧，她不自覺地這麼想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g3_laterano_cathedralballroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姐，他們竟然肯讓你來進行這場審訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還不是因為前面那七個樞機從你這裡一句話都問不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，小樂，幫個忙，把這個拆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包得這麼緊密——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，水果千層塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第七廳對嫌疑犯還真好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能啊，這當然是我自己做的。來，還有這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的畢業證書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我醒來之後的某天，聖席奧多爾綜合學校的負責人——也是我當年的老師——來看了我一趟，請我代為保管這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你當時的畢業申請沒通過，但那場畢業典禮確實足夠證明你具有優秀且專業的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，如果不是特別熟悉城際網路的防護模式，對告解車的程式邏輯瞭若指掌，怎麼可能促使那麼多告解車和你一起演出呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以學校在請示過教皇廳後，還是決定為你頒發畢業證書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你，小樂……雖然已經過了這麼多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，謝謝老姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐的信，你不可能沒收到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實當初我和爸爸媽媽還打過賭，他們賭你上了大學會主修城際網路安全，以後會成為公證所最厲害的網路安全維護專家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但姐姐覺得你絕不會浪費自己的想像力，肯定會主修信仰輔助器械設計，以後會設計出震撼全城的新款告解車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果你就這樣離開了拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個就要解釋一下了哦，老姐，我一點都不覺得遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不是不知道，我從來不留遺憾，更不會讓別人替我遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然你也不會那麼著急地提前修完所有的專業課程學分，還辦了一場那樣轟動的畢業典禮，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還從莫斯提馬那裡問到了很多關於你的事情，你在龍門的工作、你的老闆、你的同事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐知道你去了敘拉古、薩爾貢，去了很多地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐也知道你每天都在和各式各樣的人打交道，黑幫、警察、家族、王酋……忙得不可開交……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼這些事情從莫斯提馬口中說出來就不一樣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，離開拉特蘭後，我真的有在好好生活，也沒有不開心啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說再說，那時候你在醫院，不知道怎麼受傷的，也不知道能不能醒，莫斯提馬還偏偏一個字也不願意說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須知道發生了什麼事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟你是我老姐啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不過那傢伙一直躲著我，我從她嘴裡什麼都沒逼問出來就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別怪莫斯提馬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姐，其實這幾年，我也學到了不少東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情，如果一直待在拉特蘭，我可能完全不會去想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在龍門的時候，我身邊的薩科塔就只有莫斯提馬，那傢伙還失去了共感的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯、空、可頌、拜松，還有老闆……一開始，我在拉特蘭是怎麼交朋友的，我也就怎麼和他們相處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也確實成為了很要好很真誠的朋友，但畢竟無法共感，我還是經常忍不住會想一些有的沒的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過每次解決了亂七八糟的想法之後，我們的關係只會變得更要好更真誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不像現在，你就坐在我的對面，我什麼都不想，就能感受到老姐你想換個地方，這樣就能好好抱我一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共感究竟讓我們變成了一個怎樣的集體呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共感究竟讓我們更敏感，還是更遲鈍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……遲鈍到我們更容易去接受那些根本不合理的變化。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和你回來後做的種種事情有關嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姐，拉特蘭生病了，就跟你那時候一樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得把它叫醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小樂，你需要交代全部的細節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姐，門後面就是戍衛隊的人吧？你剛剛進來的時候，我聽見聲音了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“這是最後的機會了……”之類的囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……如果在本輪審訊中你仍拒不交代破壞萬國峰會的原因以及你背後的勢力，第七廳將不得不將你移交出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小樂，我不清楚你會面臨怎樣的懲罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的寬容與仁慈向來不施予觸犯了律法的人，尤其是如今的拉特蘭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"口令，“美乃滋蘋果派！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸聲來自樓下，怎、怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怖襲擊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前在城裡引起騷亂的那個嫌犯，不是正在樓上接受審問嗎？還有什麼人敢對第七廳的辦公大樓發動恐怖襲擊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自律告解車，編號“ELCARO-001”，已就位！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告、告解車？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自律告解車","speakerId":"avg_4188_confes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發射。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，什麼情況？誰把它放進來的，沒注意到它有問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，那只是一輛告解車啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，是誰想到在告解車上裝這麼多銃的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警告，警告，一輛告解車向我們發動了攻擊，並試圖救援嫌犯蕾繆樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有作戰單位，立即到場支援！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重複！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再、再一顆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸斷左邊的樓梯，多少能再拖延他們一陣……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小樂姐，聽得到嗎？我來救你了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梵妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真聰明，竟然想到要找這輛告解車幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有，我想了好久好久，才想起來……之前小樂姐攔下這輛車的時候，我看了一眼它的編號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告解車的編號正常應該是“LC”開頭，“拉特蘭自律告解車”的縮寫，但是它的編號卻是“ELC”開頭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自律告解車","speakerId":"avg_4188_confes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她幾乎跑遍了拉特蘭的大街小巷，一輛一輛地攔告解車看……直到我注意到了她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自律告解車","speakerId":"avg_4188_confes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，能天使，戍衛隊的支援很快就會抵達，育嬰聖堂的衛兵也已經趕來了，我們需要儘快脫身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i23"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"戍衛隊的反應很快，他們在極短的時間內架設好了上樓的緊急通道，列陣向動亂的位置集結。\n能天使撞開了門，告解車加速向她靠近，擋住了戍衛隊的攻擊，她一頭撞進車廂，在幅度極大的偏移中穩住身形。\n薩科塔的紅髮在彈幕與煙塵中飄揚！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告解師……呃，不對，既然你已經暴露，那我是不是終於可以正常稱呼你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真是拉！風！爆！了！老闆，義人，博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"車子前方的架子上有六把銃。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"車廂內有三把銃。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"任意取用，不用客氣。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"做你最擅長的事情。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"梵里妮更換了銃彈，不會造成致命傷。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"至於是否會傷害到同胞，我相信你的命中率。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了！剛好我的守護銃被第七廳的人沒收了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"兩側的通道已經很難突圍。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"需要重新規劃脫身的路線。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就走窗戶，越熱鬧越好，吸引注意力，也方便讓梵妮溜走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你應該不會解體吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那你千萬別被我甩出去囉。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"路交給我，追兵交給你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。老闆，派對正式開始，讓我們來一場天衣無縫的配合！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你不知道能天使一個人是怎麼玩轉那麼多把銃，製造出足以壓制整支戍衛隊的彈幕的。\n你也不確定從那麼高的窗戶撞出去，現實中的自己會不會真的出什麼問題。\n你只是，帶著她刺向了天光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"搖滾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"彈幕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蘋果……呃，算了算了！不太適合這個場合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼~累死了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總算甩掉這些尾巴了，還真不容易啊。戍衛隊的反應什麼時候這麼快了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小樂，你果然會從天台離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從小到大，你總是不走尋常的路啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老、老姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那輛告解車，還有那個女孩子，是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，都是我的好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才在審訊中說，你做了那麼多違背律法的事情，是為了叫醒拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從來都不會講什麼大道理，不會用那些精妙的修辭手法去委婉解釋一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“叫醒拉特蘭”，你的意思是，這座城市裡的每一個人都需要被叫醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……幾句話無法解釋清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看著我，小樂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隔著一道屋脊，蕾繆安看著自己的妹妹。陽光很刺眼，但“看著我”是一道溫柔的命令，所以能天使連眼睛都沒有眨。\n良久，蕾繆安與能天使都沒有說話。沉默連接了這兩個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姐你就這樣……放我走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才剛當上第七廳的樞機，要是被人發現你放走了重要嫌犯，這樣沒辦法交差吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得領取這把守護銃的時候，製銃師問我要選什麼數字作為它的編號嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，老姐你當時連想都沒想……我記得那串數字，是爸爸媽媽帶你回家的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我跟自己說，要永遠守護你和爸爸媽媽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，老姐，你就不怕別人說你包庇我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你誤會了，小樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"決意守護一些人一些事的前提，是信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的相處、我們的共感、我們的瞭解、我們的連繫……讓我相信我的妹妹，相信她的判斷和選擇是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，這並非包庇。相反，沒有比這更充分的理由了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……姐姐，你跟我一起行動吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所懷疑的，我同樣有過懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我在這個位置，還能做到一些事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這個方向，沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們是一路追過來的——奇怪，突然就不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑這麼快，告解車的引擎動力有這麼強勁嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近的岔路太多，而且那輛車還和蕾繆樂分頭逃跑了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯絡公證所，請求執行者支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，讓他們透過城際網路搜尋全城所有的自律告解車，看能不能找到那輛編號為“ELC-001”的告解車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_371_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面前面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咬牙切齒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吃力地蹬車）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還好，清理完逃跑的路線，總算趕上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不允許你被拉特蘭人拆成零件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"辛苦了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，不得不佩服你的敏銳和決斷，僅憑幾個薩科塔幹員有些異常的診斷報告，就做出了拉特蘭會突發災異的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是我們再晚一點行動，恐怕就一點忙都幫不上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"發生在羅德島的慘痛變故才過去了幾個月……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那場變故後，羅德島必須留意每一處異樣。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭正負責聯絡各地辦事處的幹員……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可露希爾要忙著重組那些新的地塊……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"精英幹員們在全力檢查本艦內的所有風險……","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是你在第一時間選擇與我同行。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用謝。雖然說過去在這個位置上的，一直是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，Dr.{@nickname}，接下來該怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"潛伏了這麼久，這下算是前功盡棄了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們必須保證能天使接下來仍能正常行動。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"繼續隱藏行跡的意義已經不大。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"的確，那場奇怪的儀式已經完成，而且也有人從“夢境”裡醒過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我確信那台機器已經對此作出了應對，所以教皇廳和育嬰聖堂的動作都在加速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它仍然想要所有人把夢做完，完成它的，嗯……“試驗”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡我施展不出任何手段，你還遭到它的資訊管控，被迫以這副樣子出現！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的引擎動力還被限制了，跑起來慢慢的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"幸好有你在，Mon3tr。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，短時間內我也找不到別的東西來拉你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咬牙堅持）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……博士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把你的車廂打開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那裡面放了甜甜圈對吧——呼哧——我得補充能量！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咬牙切齒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（拔足狂奔，揮舞利爪）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還能撐下去嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還蠻習慣的……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"還好，和以前你帶著我的時候沒有區別。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是開玩笑的時候，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些長著光環的怪物，育嬰聖堂在“夢境”裡孵育的怪物怎麼會入侵現實？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"注意看那些建築上的投影。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"注意看周圍那些詭異的色彩。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真羡慕你，被我掛在爪子上，竟然還有閒工夫去注意細節！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幸好你的動態視力夠好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，牠們快追上來了！沒時間多想了，忍住——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"呃啊啊啊啊——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你剛提到的那些異常，是什麼意思！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"並非“夢境”的崩毀影響了現實。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"“夢境”只是假像，它早就訴諸現實。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……所以拉特蘭的混亂，並不是因為那台機器失控——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反，它把所有人拖入這場群體性的幻夢，是為了最高效地同步演算，輸出一個它預先設定好的結果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——如果它全功率運轉，確實能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們需要知道……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"它最終想要將拉特蘭變成什麼樣子。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"究竟是什麼促使它做出這樣的決定。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Mon3tr，你找到“接點”了嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從我們得到線索來到拉特蘭，再到進入那個“夢境”，我嘗試了各種辦法。但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（用力搖頭）那台機器的運作邏輯太特殊，我還需要時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論是在夢裡面的拉特蘭，還是在現實的拉特蘭，我們都已經暴露了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市正在進行排異反應，而我們就像兩個病毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們的當務之急是……呼哧……活命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"災異已經降臨，你終於篤定。\n但此刻來不及抒發什麼感慨，你和Mon3tr正在虛假與真實裡狂奔，逃避身後……\n不，尋找宿命的線索。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你本來對與Mon3tr共同加入這趟拉特蘭的旅途忐忑不安，如今反倒在顛簸中放下了某些顧慮。\n不知不覺中，你已經坦然地將自己的生命安危託付給她了……\n託付給Mon3tr。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"謝謝你，Mon3tr。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g8_catastrophicsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為是我眼花了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要去跟我們共同的好友打個招呼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續行動，阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然不擔心博士的安危？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這並非目前的最優先事項。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有見過帶著博士逃跑的那個女性，但她的外形和作戰方式似曾相識。有她在，博士暫時沒有危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，博士吸引走了多數的怪物，這為我們創造了脫身的機會。儘快離開這裡，找到教宗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費迪，我會幫你把剛剛這番話加進羅德島的任務報告裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己會寫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
